00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:44.000
So a lot of people migrated south. And TVA's power production couldn't keep up with the growing demand from both war manufacturers and people living in the Valley. So they started to build more coal power plants. And they ended up building 11 of the world's largest coal fire power plants. Partially to serve Oak Ridge, but also again,

