this like all centering around the people that are cleanup crews and how they were exposed to this. Cole Ash, what ended up happening? So after 10 brutal years of litigation where the case gets basically thrown out twice, the lawyers save it on appeal twice, the workers have to, they have to capitulate. They're getting so sick and they're getting

